<title>USA: Greenspan prepared testimony unchanged.</title>
<headline>Greenspan prepared testimony unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prepared testimony by Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan Wednesday before a House Banking subcommittee was unchanged from what was delivered last Thursday to the Senate Banking Committee in the first leg of his Humphrey-Hawkins testimony.</p>
</text>
